    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Math was always my safe spot. Even with a vocational diploma, I self-taught algebra and calculus for fun—it’s like solving puzzles. My parents never pushed academics, but I saw patterns in chemistry and math that others missed. Now, I use it for my gardening measurements and even to balance my small business finances. It’s practical, not just theoretical.",
